{"id":"627536","name":"槐花鸡蛋煎饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/627536/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"槐花","amount":"一把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"槐树。","img":"images/627536/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘新鲜的槐花。","img":"images/627536/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淘洗干净，控水。","img":"images/627536/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盆中放入适量槐花、鸡蛋、少许面粉和盐。","img":"images/627536/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加少许水,顺时针搅拌均匀成稀糊状。","img":"images/627536/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"平底锅烧热放少许油,倒入面糊，摊匀。","img":"images/627536/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小火慢煎。","img":"images/627536/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻面,煎至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/627536/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/627536/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切片装盘。","img":"images/627536/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"清香美味。","img":"images/627536/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}